TEXT -552 -304 Left 2 !.tran 0 60u 50u 1n\n \n.param first_edge 200 ; 200th edge\n.param last_edge 700 ; 700th edge\n.param zero_crossing_voltage 0 ; voltage at zero crossing\n.meas tran T1 find time when V(osc_out)={zero_crossing_voltage} rise {first_edge}\n.meas tran T2 find time when V(osc_out)={zero_crossing_voltage} rise {last_edge}\n.meas tran Frequency param ({last_edge}-{first_edge})/(T2-T1)\n.options numdgt=7\n.options plotwinsize=0
TEXT 232 344 Left 2 ;VFO for broadcast FM when C4 = 15 pF to 33 pF\nDisadvantage is that voltage over C4 is 33 Vpp.  This is not suitable for varicaps.\nCapacitor in series with C4 is needed, to reduce voltage over C4.  The drawback is that\nC4 will have to change a lot more to yield the equivalent 18 pF capacitance change.
